The programs of ImageMagick 7 and ImageMagick 6 in one package, with JPEG, PNG,
WebP, GIF, HEIC and AVIF only and the policy of
graphics/ImageMagick7/files/policy.xml of azsupport/ports: bin/magick and the
usual names linked to it (convert, identify, ...), as in ImageMagick7, and
ImageMagick 6 as bin/convert6, identify6, mogrify6, composite6 and the others.
Their libraries, headers, configuration and policy are the packages
libimagemagick6 and libimagemagick7. It conflicts with ImageMagick6 and
ImageMagick7. Versions and options: share/doc/ImageMagick6/VERSIONS and
share/doc/ImageMagick7/VERSIONS of those.
